## Implementation Order

1. [ ] Update settings.yaml (webcam, violation config, storage paths)
2. [ ] Update detector.py (PaddleOCR for license plates)
3. [ ] Enhance tracker.py (violation detection)
4. [ ] Create violation_detector.py service
5. [ ] Update models.py (TrafficViolation model)
6. [ ] Update logger.py (CSV + DB dual storage)
7. [ ] Update main.py (new API endpoints)
8. [ ] Redesign index.html (new layout)
9. [ ] Update style.css
10. [ ] Update app.js (violation display with date/time/plate)
11. [ ] Test with webcam

## Verification

1. Run [.\run.bat](file:///a:/TAVISO/run.bat) and open http://localhost:8000
2. Point camera at traffic video/scene
3. Verify violations appear with: Date | Time | License Plate
4. Check `data/csv/violations.csv` and `data/database/violations.db`
